[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4986.07, "timestamp": "01:23:06", "text": "所以，呃，你也能看到你自己，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4988.79, "timestamp": "01:23:08", "text": "YouTube 用户，Twitch 用户。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4990.47, "timestamp": "01:23:10", "text": "今天的直播结束后，我也会把"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4993.189, "timestamp": "01:23:13", "text": "Twitch 聊天记录整合到这里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4996.07, "timestamp": "01:23:16", "text": "所以，是的。所以，这里有所有 Twitch 和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4999.27, "timestamp": "01:23:19", "text": "YouTube 的数据。呃，如果有人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5001.669, "timestamp": "01:23:21", "text": "现在来我的直播间，比如所有来"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5004.629, "timestamp": "01:23:24", "text": "过他们聊天室的人，你可以公开看到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5008.95, "timestamp": "01:23:28", "text": "。是的，你在这里的方式可以公开看到。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5011.03, "timestamp": "01:23:31", "text": "真的很好。还有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5014.229, "timestamp": "01:23:34", "text": "直播概要。呃，这个，呃，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5016.47, "timestamp": "01:23:36", "text": "要把它的名字改成我自己的想法，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5019.189, "timestamp": "01:23:39", "text": "比如“狗狗的东西”之类的。“章节”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5022.79, "timestamp": "01:23:42", "text": "是基于 AI 的。所以，这些文字稿，对吧，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5026.55, "timestamp": "01:23:46", "text": "这些字幕，比如 SRT 格式的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5029.51, "timestamp": "01:23:49", "text": "YouTube 直播内容，会被发送给 AI，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5034.31, "timestamp": "01:23:54", "text": "AI 会给我生成 AI 章节"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5036.47, "timestamp": "01:23:56", "text": "和 AI 概要。这些可能会显示在"}]